<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Get Your Wish (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859256"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:23.224"><div begin="00:09.118" end="05:23.224"><p begin="00:09.118" end="00:11.734" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:09.118" end="00:09.341">"I’ll</span> <span begin="00:09.341" end="00:09.660">make</span> <span begin="00:09.660" end="00:09.968">it</span> <span begin="00:09.968" end="00:10.733">right</span> <span begin="00:11.056" end="00:11.253">a</span><span begin="00:11.253" end="00:11.734">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我再怎么让一切重回当初</span></p><p begin="00:11.734" end="00:14.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:11.734" end="00:11.964">But</span> <span begin="00:11.964" end="00:12.303">it’s</span> <span begin="00:12.303" end="00:12.588">no</span> <span begin="00:12.588" end="00:13.266">use</span><span begin="00:13.266" end="00:13.266">,"</span> <span begin="00:13.443" end="00:13.601">you</span> <span begin="00:13.601" end="00:14.198">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也已无力回天了”你说</span></p><p begin="00:14.523" end="00:18.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:14.523" end="00:14.718">As</span> <span begin="00:14.718" end="00:15.195">my</span> <span begin="00:15.195" end="00:15.788">hun</span><span begin="00:15.788" end="00:16.423">ger</span> <span begin="00:16.423" end="00:17.102">grows</span> <span begin="00:17.102" end="00:17.548">and</span> <span begin="00:17.548" end="00:18.608">grows</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即便我的渴望 仍旧日与俱增</span></p><p begin="00:19.243" end="00:23.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:19.243" end="00:19.518">I</span> <span begin="00:19.518" end="00:19.742">have</span> <span begin="00:19.742" end="00:20.050">to</span> <span begin="00:20.050" end="00:20.830">write</span> <span begin="00:21.138" end="00:21.342">the</span> <span begin="00:21.342" end="00:21.645">mea</span><span begin="00:21.645" end="00:21.943">ning</span> <span begin="00:21.943" end="00:22.272">of</span> <span begin="00:22.272" end="00:22.572">my</span> <span begin="00:22.572" end="00:23.745">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有必要书写下人生的意义</span></p><p begin="00:24.615" end="00:28.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:24.615" end="00:24.780">Or</span> <span begin="00:24.780" end="00:25.293">else</span> <span begin="00:25.293" end="00:25.930">e</span><span begin="00:25.930" end="00:26.508">very</span><span begin="00:26.508" end="00:27.180">thing’s</span> <span begin="00:27.180" end="00:27.650">in</span> <span begin="00:27.650" end="00:28.243">vain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">否则一切只是徒劳而已</span></p><p begin="00:29.623" end="00:34.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:29.623" end="00:29.980">When</span> <span begin="00:29.980" end="00:30.318">the</span> <span begin="00:30.318" end="00:30.965">glo</span><span begin="00:30.965" end="00:31.483">ry</span> <span begin="00:31.483" end="00:32.244">tries</span> <span begin="00:32.244" end="00:33.063">to</span> <span begin="00:33.063" end="00:33.840">tempt</span> <span begin="00:33.840" end="00:34.323">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="00:34.785" end="00:39.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:34.785" end="00:35.077">When</span> <span begin="00:35.077" end="00:35.362">the</span> <span begin="00:35.362" end="00:36.046">glo</span><span begin="00:36.046" end="00:36.568">ry</span> <span begin="00:36.568" end="00:37.265">tries</span> <span begin="00:37.265" end="00:37.864">to</span> <span begin="00:37.864" end="00:39.010">tempt</span> <span begin="00:39.010" end="00:39.489">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="00:39.830" end="00:45.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:39.830" end="00:40.113">When</span> <span begin="00:40.113" end="00:40.438">the</span> <span begin="00:40.438" end="00:41.092">glo</span><span begin="00:41.092" end="00:41.690">ry</span> <span begin="00:41.690" end="00:42.317">tries</span> <span begin="00:42.317" end="00:42.953">to</span> <span begin="00:42.953" end="00:44.051">tempt</span> <span begin="00:44.051" end="00:45.651">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="01:09.710" end="01:12.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:09.710" end="01:09.968">"I’ll</span> <span begin="01:09.968" end="01:10.250">make</span> <span begin="01:10.250" end="01:10.625">it</span> <span begin="01:10.625" end="01:11.337">right</span> <span begin="01:11.660" end="01:11.829">a</span><span begin="01:11.829" end="01:12.313">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我再怎么让一切重回当初</span></p><p begin="01:12.313" end="01:14.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:12.313" end="01:12.440">But</span> <span begin="01:12.440" end="01:12.799">it’s</span> <span begin="01:12.799" end="01:13.125">no</span> <span begin="01:13.125" end="01:13.848">use,"</span> <span begin="01:14.055" end="01:14.330">you</span> <span begin="01:14.330" end="01:14.935">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也已无力回天了”你说</span></p><p begin="01:15.114" end="01:19.296" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:15.114" end="01:15.277">As</span> <span begin="01:15.277" end="01:15.748">my</span> <span begin="01:15.748" end="01:16.358">hun</span><span begin="01:16.358" end="01:17.015">ger</span> <span begin="01:17.015" end="01:17.699">grows</span> <span begin="01:17.699" end="01:18.184">and</span> <span begin="01:18.184" end="01:18.982">grow</span><span begin="01:18.982" end="01:19.296">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即便我的渴望 仍旧日与俱增</span></p><p begin="01:19.782" end="01:24.595" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:19.782" end="01:20.058">I</span> <span begin="01:20.058" end="01:20.358">have</span> <span begin="01:20.358" end="01:20.663">to</span> <span begin="01:20.663" end="01:21.790">write</span> <span begin="01:21.790" end="01:21.955">the</span> <span begin="01:21.955" end="01:22.283">mea</span><span begin="01:22.283" end="01:22.557">ning</span> <span begin="01:22.557" end="01:22.890">of</span> <span begin="01:22.890" end="01:23.222">my</span> <span begin="01:23.222" end="01:24.595">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有必要书写下人生的意义</span></p><p begin="01:25.342" end="01:28.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:25.342" end="01:25.446">Or</span> <span begin="01:25.446" end="01:25.887">else</span> <span begin="01:25.887" end="01:26.530">e</span><span begin="01:26.530" end="01:27.148">very</span><span begin="01:27.148" end="01:27.845">thing’s</span> <span begin="01:27.845" end="01:28.287">in</span> <span begin="01:28.287" end="01:28.963">vain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">否则一切只是徒劳而已</span></p><p begin="01:30.193" end="01:35.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:30.193" end="01:30.601">When</span> <span begin="01:30.601" end="01:30.925">the</span> <span begin="01:30.925" end="01:31.548">glo</span><span begin="01:31.548" end="01:32.108">ry</span> <span begin="01:32.108" end="01:32.870">tries</span> <span begin="01:32.870" end="01:33.632">to</span> <span begin="01:33.632" end="01:34.495">tempt</span> <span begin="01:34.495" end="01:35.032">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当荣誉令你蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="01:35.360" end="01:39.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:35.360" end="01:35.685">It</span> <span begin="01:35.685" end="01:36.005">may</span> <span begin="01:36.005" end="01:36.703">seem</span> <span begin="01:36.703" end="01:37.280">like</span> <span begin="01:37.280" end="01:37.715">what</span> <span begin="01:37.715" end="01:38.174">you</span> <span begin="01:38.174" end="01:39.070">need</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">似乎完美贴合你所需</span></p><p begin="01:40.389" end="01:42.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:40.389" end="01:40.589">But</span> <span begin="01:40.589" end="01:40.920">if</span> <span begin="01:40.920" end="01:41.379">glo</span><span begin="01:41.379" end="01:41.507">ry</span> <span begin="01:41.507" end="01:41.913">makes</span> <span begin="01:41.913" end="01:42.180">you</span> <span begin="01:42.180" end="01:42.419">hap</span><span begin="01:42.419" end="01:42.742">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果它真能使你开心</span></p><p begin="01:42.742" end="01:45.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:42.742" end="01:43.080">Why</span> <span begin="01:43.080" end="01:43.403">are</span> <span begin="01:43.403" end="01:43.873">you</span> <span begin="01:43.873" end="01:44.222">so</span> <span begin="01:44.222" end="01:44.472">bro</span><span begin="01:44.472" end="01:44.782">ken</span> <span begin="01:44.782" end="01:45.684">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为何你如今还是失魂落魄呢</span></p><p begin="01:51.780" end="01:53.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:51.780" end="01:52.437">So</span> <span begin="01:52.437" end="01:53.097">tell</span> <span begin="01:53.097" end="01:53.735">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:53.735" end="01:58.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:53.735" end="01:54.336">How</span> <span begin="01:54.336" end="01:54.704">it</span> <span begin="01:54.704" end="01:55.652">felt</span> <span begin="01:55.927" end="01:56.062">when</span> <span begin="01:56.062" end="01:56.194">you</span> <span begin="01:56.194" end="01:56.824">walked</span> <span begin="01:56.824" end="01:57.402">on</span> <span begin="01:57.402" end="01:58.069">wa</span><span begin="01:58.069" end="01:58.753">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="01:58.753" end="02:02.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:58.753" end="01:59.226">Did</span> <span begin="01:59.226" end="01:59.647">you</span> <span begin="01:59.647" end="02:00.519">get</span> <span begin="02:00.519" end="02:01.144">your</span> <span begin="02:01.144" end="02:02.207">wish?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="02:02.474" end="02:04.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:02.474" end="02:02.949">Floa</span><span begin="02:02.949" end="02:03.219">ting</span> <span begin="02:03.219" end="02:03.457">to</span> <span begin="02:03.457" end="02:03.750">the</span> <span begin="02:03.750" end="02:04.283">sur</span><span begin="02:04.283" end="02:04.784">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你越想下沉</span></p><p begin="02:05.039" end="02:07.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:05.039" end="02:05.389">Qui</span><span begin="02:05.389" end="02:05.696">cker</span> <span begin="02:05.696" end="02:05.954">than</span> <span begin="02:05.954" end="02:06.252">you</span> <span begin="02:06.252" end="02:07.035">san</span><span begin="02:07.035" end="02:07.439">k</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:08.131" end="02:12.482"><span begin="02:08.131" end="02:08.766">(I</span><span begin="02:08.766" end="02:09.691">dol</span> <span begin="02:10.576" end="02:11.381">i</span><span begin="02:11.381" end="02:12.482">dol)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却越难抵上浮</span></p><p begin="02:12.114" end="02:13.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:12.114" end="02:12.606">So</span> <span begin="02:12.606" end="02:13.276">tell</span> <span begin="02:13.276" end="02:13.966">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:13.966" end="02:18.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:13.966" end="02:14.548">How</span> <span begin="02:14.548" end="02:14.820">it</span> <span begin="02:14.820" end="02:15.786">felt</span> <span begin="02:16.111" end="02:16.263">when</span> <span begin="02:16.263" end="02:16.436">you</span> <span begin="02:16.436" end="02:17.018">walked</span> <span begin="02:17.018" end="02:17.653">on</span> <span begin="02:17.653" end="02:18.354">wa</span><span begin="02:18.354" end="02:18.910">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="02:18.910" end="02:22.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:18.910" end="02:19.418">Did</span> <span begin="02:19.418" end="02:19.845">you</span> <span begin="02:19.845" end="02:20.781">get</span> <span begin="02:20.781" end="02:21.418">your</span> <span begin="02:21.418" end="02:22.383">wish?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否如愿以偿？</span></p><p begin="02:22.683" end="02:25.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:22.683" end="02:23.093">Floa</span><span begin="02:23.093" end="02:23.352">ting</span> <span begin="02:23.352" end="02:23.643">to</span> <span begin="02:23.643" end="02:23.963">the</span> <span begin="02:23.963" end="02:24.478">sur</span><span begin="02:24.478" end="02:25.027">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你越想下沉</span></p><p begin="02:25.227" end="02:27.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:25.227" end="02:25.591">Qui</span><span begin="02:25.591" end="02:25.884">cker</span> <span begin="02:25.884" end="02:26.178">than</span> <span begin="02:26.178" end="02:26.503">you</span> <span begin="02:26.503" end="02:27.477">san</span><span begin="02:27.477" end="02:27.955">k</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:28.380" end="02:32.505"><span begin="02:28.380" end="02:29.017">(I</span><span begin="02:29.017" end="02:29.845">dol</span> <span begin="02:30.880" end="02:31.593">i</span><span begin="02:31.593" end="02:32.505">dol)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却越难抵上浮</span></p><p begin="02:43.200" end="02:45.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:43.200" end="02:43.475">Don’t</span> <span begin="02:43.475" end="02:43.752">say</span> <span begin="02:43.752" end="02:44.055">you</span> <span begin="02:44.055" end="02:44.832">lose</span> <span begin="02:45.132" end="02:45.245">just</span> <span begin="02:45.245" end="02:45.794">yet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻 你还不能认输</span></p><p begin="02:45.794" end="02:48.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:45.794" end="02:45.975">Get</span> <span begin="02:45.975" end="02:46.278">up</span> <span begin="02:46.278" end="02:46.587">and</span> <span begin="02:46.587" end="02:47.363">move</span> <span begin="02:47.688" end="02:47.835">a</span><span begin="02:47.835" end="02:48.609">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">站起来 昂首前行</span></p><p begin="02:48.609" end="02:52.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:48.609" end="02:48.918">And</span> <span begin="02:48.918" end="02:49.245">not</span> <span begin="02:49.245" end="02:49.843">on</span><span begin="02:49.843" end="02:50.478">ly</span> <span begin="02:50.478" end="02:51.103">for</span> <span begin="02:51.103" end="02:51.630">your</span><span begin="02:51.630" end="02:52.428">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这不仅仅是为了你自己</span></p><p begin="02:53.265" end="02:55.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:53.265" end="02:53.584">‘Cause</span> <span begin="02:53.584" end="02:53.857">that’s</span> <span begin="02:53.857" end="02:54.157">your</span> <span begin="02:54.157" end="02:55.226">role</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为你所扮演的角色</span></p><p begin="02:55.226" end="02:57.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:55.226" end="02:55.414">The</span> <span begin="02:55.414" end="02:55.715">work</span> <span begin="02:55.715" end="02:56.022">that</span> <span begin="02:56.022" end="02:56.364">stirred</span> <span begin="02:56.364" end="02:56.647">your</span> <span begin="02:56.647" end="02:57.593">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要以荡涤灵魂为职责</span></p><p begin="02:58.718" end="03:02.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:58.718" end="02:59.033">You</span> <span begin="02:59.033" end="02:59.336">can</span> <span begin="02:59.336" end="02:59.950">make</span> <span begin="02:59.950" end="03:00.596">for</span> <span begin="03:00.596" end="03:01.180">some</span><span begin="03:01.180" end="03:01.653">one</span> <span begin="03:01.653" end="03:02.545">else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你也可以这么为他人付出</span></p><p begin="03:03.288" end="03:07.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:03.288" end="03:03.626">One</span> <span begin="03:03.626" end="03:03.908">day</span> <span begin="03:03.908" end="03:04.216">you</span> <span begin="03:04.216" end="03:05.081">choke</span> <span begin="03:05.364" end="03:05.518">your</span> <span begin="03:05.518" end="03:05.791">ur</span><span begin="03:05.791" end="03:06.161">ges</span> <span begin="03:06.161" end="03:06.455">o</span><span begin="03:06.455" end="03:06.766">ver</span><span begin="03:06.766" end="03:07.738">flow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有一天 你满心的欲望 使你窒息</span></p><p begin="03:08.808" end="03:12.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:08.808" end="03:09.075">And</span> <span begin="03:09.075" end="03:09.373">ob</span><span begin="03:09.373" end="03:10.014">ses</span><span begin="03:10.014" end="03:10.628">sion</span> <span begin="03:10.628" end="03:11.308">wears</span> <span begin="03:11.308" end="03:11.854">you</span> <span begin="03:11.854" end="03:12.528">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而痴狂 消磨光你的意志</span></p><p begin="03:13.391" end="03:18.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:13.391" end="03:13.693">But</span> <span begin="03:13.693" end="03:14.027">don’t</span> <span begin="03:14.027" end="03:14.338">you</span> <span begin="03:14.338" end="03:15.224">waste</span> <span begin="03:15.421" end="03:15.589">the</span> <span begin="03:15.589" end="03:15.892">suf</span><span begin="03:15.892" end="03:16.224">fering</span> <span begin="03:16.224" end="03:16.871">you’ve</span> <span begin="03:16.871" end="03:18.211">faced</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但不要徒劳了你一路走来的磨难</span></p><p begin="03:18.863" end="03:22.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:18.863" end="03:19.193">It</span> <span begin="03:19.193" end="03:19.495">will</span> <span begin="03:19.495" end="03:20.266">serve</span> <span begin="03:20.266" end="03:20.781">you</span> <span begin="03:20.781" end="03:21.366">in</span> <span begin="03:21.366" end="03:21.886">due</span> <span begin="03:21.886" end="03:22.619">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">它会在关键时刻有所裨益</span></p><p begin="03:22.739" end="03:26.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:22.739" end="03:23.326">So</span> <span begin="03:23.326" end="03:23.969">tell</span> <span begin="03:23.969" end="03:24.617">me</span> <span begin="03:24.617" end="03:25.245">how</span> <span begin="03:25.245" end="03:25.474">it</span> <span begin="03:25.474" end="03:26.557">felt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="03:26.773" end="03:29.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:26.773" end="03:26.921">When</span> <span begin="03:26.921" end="03:27.098">you</span> <span begin="03:27.098" end="03:27.714">walked</span> <span begin="03:27.714" end="03:28.336">on</span> <span begin="03:28.336" end="03:28.989">wa</span><span begin="03:28.989" end="03:29.589">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漫步水上的感受如何</span></p><p begin="03:29.589" end="03:33.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:29.589" end="03:30.092">Did</span> <span begin="03:30.092" end="03:30.533">you</span> <span begin="03:30.533" end="03:31.612">get</span> <span begin="03:31.612" end="03:32.150">your</span> <span begin="03:32.150" end="03:33.057">wish?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="03:33.377" end="03:35.921" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:33.377" end="03:33.795">Floa</span><span begin="03:33.795" end="03:34.095">ting</span> <span begin="03:34.095" end="03:34.352">to</span> <span begin="03:34.352" end="03:34.635">the</span> <span begin="03:34.635" end="03:35.175">sur</span><span begin="03:35.175" end="03:35.921">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你越想下沉</span></p><p begin="03:35.921" end="03:38.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:35.921" end="03:36.277">Qui</span><span begin="03:36.277" end="03:36.568">cker</span> <span begin="03:36.568" end="03:36.869">than</span> <span begin="03:36.869" end="03:37.185">you</span> <span begin="03:37.185" end="03:38.051">san</span><span begin="03:38.051" end="03:38.399">k</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:39.004" end="03:43.151"><span begin="03:39.004" end="03:39.733">(I</span><span begin="03:39.733" end="03:40.598">dol</span> <span begin="03:41.545" end="03:42.319">i</span><span begin="03:42.319" end="03:43.151">dol)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却越难抵上浮</span></p><p begin="03:42.964" end="03:44.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:42.964" end="03:43.552">So</span> <span begin="03:43.552" end="03:44.226">tell</span> <span begin="03:44.226" end="03:44.802">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉我</span></p><p begin="03:44.802" end="03:49.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key=